      "description": "Your ultimate river companion for New Zealand adventures! \n\nWhether you're into whitewater kayaking, rafting, fishing, 4WD missions, or jetboating, FlowRate helps you stay ahead of the river conditions with real-time data and forecasts - all in one powerful app.\n\nPlan your next outdoor adventure with confidence.\n\nNo more wasted missions or surprise conditions - FlowRate helps you pick the perfect time to head out based on river levels, recent rainfall, and dam release schedules. \n\nWhether you're chasing that epic whitewater run, planning a quiet morning on the river with your rod, or navigating 4WD trails that rely on stream crossings, FlowRate gives you the insights you need to go prepared and stay safe.\n\nFeatures:\n- Interactive map with key rivers across NZ\n- Live river flow rates, water levels, and gate readings\n- 24-hour flow rate change tracking\n- Rain forecasts to help you anticipate rising water levels\n- Historical flow data including peak levels from the past 7 days\n- Up-to-date weather conditions\n\nMissing a river you love? Tap ‘Request a River’ and we’ll do our best to add it!",
